  "prefLabel": "Par 203.08 Reconsideration Hearings",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-07-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 203.08 Reconsideration Hearings. The board shall hold a reconsideration hearing for any inmate previously approved for parole who receives a disciplinary write-up prior to release. At the reconsideration hearing the board shall determine the effect of the disciplinary upon the inmate’s release date. The standard setback shall be 60 days for a minor disciplinary and 90 days for a major disciplinary.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17 (formerly Par 203.09)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/par100-500.html"
